#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:99
msgid ""
"New firewall page: see what is open to the network, allow an app or a port, "
"and close the high ports with strict mode."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:104
msgid ""
"New system check: quick health checks and a report to share when asking for "
"help, without your name or network addresses."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:109
msgid ""
"New module to free disk space: see what each cache takes and clean the ones "
"you pick."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:114
msgid "Password prompts in Brazilian Portuguese and updated screenshots."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:119
msgid ""
"Changing the language now also takes effect on Xfce and other desktops that "
"keep a per-user language."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:124
msgid ""
"Fixes mounting disks at startup on systems whose /etc/fstab has no warnings "
"at all."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:129
msgid ""
"New module to mount extra disks automatically at startup, safely: a missing "
"disk never stops the computer from starting."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:134
msgid ""
"New language and formats module: choose the system language and, separately, "
"how dates, numbers and money are shown, and install the language pack."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:139
msgid ""
"New Brazilian keyboard module: pick ABNT2 or US International, make ' + c "
"type ç in every app, and use the same layout on the login screen."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:144
msgid ""
"New module to play any video or music: complete codecs, hardware video "
"acceleration, RPM Fusion and all Flathub apps, in one place."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:149
msgid ""
"New Settings tab with configuration modules grouped by category and a "
"search. The first module caps how much disk the system logs may use."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:154
msgid "Capivara Fetch is now COS Config Center, with a new name and logo."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.capivaraos.Config.metainfo.xml.in:159
msgid "First public preview: system info view and shareable specs card."
msgstr ""

